### Detect a platform
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://x.com/user/status/1234567890"}

### Resolve a supported public/share link through the universal resolver
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/resolve/universal
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@creator/video/1234567890123456789"}

### Create a universal download job
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/downloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": ["https://x.com/user/status/1234567890"],
  "prefer_quality": "best",
  "include_caption": true,
  "filename_template": "{platform}_{author}_{post_id}_{index}"
}
